  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A transparent slab of thickness d has a refractive index n (z) that increases with z. Here z is the vertical distance inside the slab, measured from the top. The slab is placed between two media with uniform refractive indices <math><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi> </mi><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>></mo><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi></math> as shown in the figure. A ray of light is incident with angle <math><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></math> from medium 1 and emerges in medium 2 with refraction angle <math><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></math> with a lateral displacement <math><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></math> . Which of the following statement(s) is (are) true?<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/Phy_6.jpg\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "wbIY6",
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></math>  is independent of  <math><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bCIHv",
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></math>  is dependent on n (z)",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "oBjiD",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
